#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9433 expect=skipped domain=TP
# Rule:Description: CDISC-SEND-9433 — the Required key RSTGCD is not populated.
#note "RSTGCD is absent from TP, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(RSTGCD) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-1
dataset TP
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col TPSEQ type=Char
col RSTG type=Char
---
S1      | TP     | 1     | F0 Generation
---
